{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09351","headline":"襄武馆游眺 · 韦应物","name":"襄武馆游眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"州民知礼让，讼简得遨游。\n高亭凭古地，山川当暮秋。\n是时秔稻熟，西望尽田畴。\n仰恩慙政拙，念劳喜岁收。\n澹泊风景晏，缭绕云树幽。\n节往情恻恻，天高思悠悠。\n嘉宾幸云集，芳罇始淹留。\n还希习池赏，聊以驻鸣驺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}